  "menuHowToPlay": "How to Play",
  "howToTitle": "How to Play",
  "howToGoalTitle": "Goal",
  "howToGoalBody": "Each round, play melds from your rack to reach the target score. You have 4 hands; miss the target and the run is over. Clear all 8 floors from the Underworld to the Sky to reach Tengri.",
  "howToTurnTitle": "How a round works",
  "howToTurnBody": "• Tap tiles to select 1–6; the middle shows the hand type and its score.\n• Play: the selected tiles score and new tiles are drawn.\n• Discard: throw the selected tiles away and draw new ones (3 per round).\n• Drag tiles to arrange them, or use Number / Color to sort.",
  "howToOkeyTitle": "Indicator and Okey",
  "howToOkeyBody": "At the start of a round an Indicator tile is shown. The tile one above it (same color; 1 after 13) is this round's Okey, shown with a star and a gold border. The Okey is wild: it can stand in for any tile in a meld and picks the best value itself. The Fake Okey (with the rune) is a normal tile carrying the Okey's value.",
  "howToScoreTitle": "Scoring",
  "howToScoreBody": "Score = Chips × Mult.\nChips = the hand's base chips + the numbers of the tiles in the meld (a 1 counts as 15). Tiles outside the meld are played but score nothing. Kuts, tile enhancements and seals raise Chips and Mult.",
  "howToHandsTitle": "Hand types",
  "howToHandsBody": "Run: same color, consecutive numbers (12-13-1 is fine, 13-1-2 is not). Group: same number, different colors. Values are at level 1; Destans level a hand type up.",
  "howToKutTitle": "Kuts",
  "howToKutBody": "Kuts are passive mythic powers (up to 5). They trigger left to right every hand; drag cards to change their order. +Mult before ×Mult usually scores more. Tap a card to see what it does.",
  "howToShopTitle": "Akçe, Bazaar and items",
  "howToShopBody": "Winning a round pays Akçe: the round reward, +1 per hand left and interest (+1 per 5 Akçe held, up to 5). In the Bazaar you buy Kuts, Destans, Tılsıms, Packs and Vouchers. A Destan levels a hand type up; a Tılsım changes the tiles you select in your rack (Iron, Gold, color, copy...). A Voucher is a permanent upgrade.",
  "howToBossTitle": "Floors and bosses",
  "howToBossBody": "Each floor has three rounds: Small Trial, Big Trial and a Boss. You may skip the Small and Big Trial for a small reward. The Boss can't be skipped and adds a restriction (e.g. Kara Kuş: the okey is not wild).",
  "howToTipsTitle": "Tips",
  "howToTipsBody": "• Keep run and group starts together; discard lonely tiles.\n• Sky Meld (Group-3 + Run-3) and long runs score a lot.\n• Reaching the target with hands left pays extra Akçe.\n• Saving Akçe earns interest; don't spend everything at once.",
  "howToHelpTooltip": "How to play?",
